{
  "about": "Pharmacology concepts, conditions and drug-reaction syndromes the Ask tab recognises in a question (no drug needed). Each is answered from its Wikipedia article (CC BY-SA); asked together with a drug ('therapeutic index of digoxin'), the drug's own sources are searched for `terms` too. Add an entry to teach the app a concept - no code change. Fields: id; label (shown); patterns (regexes on the lower-cased question - FILE ORDER MATTERS: the first matching entry wins and later overlapping matches are dropped, so put specific entries such as 'CYP3A4' before generic ones such as 'enzyme inhibitors'); wiki (exact article title - check it exists); terms (words to look for in a drug's sources and in the article); with_drug ('concept' = answer as a concept even when a drug is named; otherwise the Ask topic that already covers drug questions about it, e.g. 'pk' or 'side_effects'); defer_if (optional regex: with a drug named and this matching the question, the usual topic answers instead - 'is ibuprofen METABOLISED by CYP3A4' is a pharmacokinetics question); priority ('high' = the concept is the subject even when a drug class is named too, e.g. 'which antibiotics are safe in penicillin allergy', and words inside it are never read as a drug name).",
  "concepts": [
    {"id": "first_pass", "label": "First-pass metabolism",
     "patterns": ["first[- ]?pass(?: effect| metabolism| elimination| hepatic metabolism)?\\b", "pre-?systemic (?:metabolism|elimination)"],
     "wiki": "First pass effect",
     "terms": ["first-pass", "first pass", "presystemic", "hepatic extraction", "extensively metabolized", "oral bioavailability", "sublingual", "bioavailability"],
     "with_drug": "concept"},
    {"id": "therapeutic_index", "label": "Therapeutic index",
     "patterns": ["therapeutic (?:index|ratio|window|range|margin)", "narrow therapeutic", "\\bnti drugs?\\b"],
     "wiki": "Therapeutic index",
     "terms": ["therapeutic index", "therapeutic range", "therapeutic window", "narrow therapeutic", "serum concentration", "serum concentrations", "plasma concentration", "ng/mL", "toxic concentrations", "toxicity"],
     "with_drug": "concept"},
    {"id": "tdm", "label": "Therapeutic drug monitoring",
     "patterns": ["therapeutic drug monitoring", "\\btdm\\b", "(?:drug|serum|plasma|trough) levels? (?:monitor\\w*|check\\w*|test\\w*|measur\\w*)", "monitor\\w* (?:the )?(?:drug |serum |plasma |trough )?levels\\b"],
     "wiki": "Therapeutic drug monitoring",
     "terms": ["serum concentration", "serum concentrations", "plasma concentration", "trough", "monitor", "monitoring", "levels", "ng/mL"],
     "with_drug": "concept"},
    {"id": "zero_order", "label": "Zero-order (saturable) kinetics",
